{
  "$comment": "Strings made only of these terms (plus punctuation, digits and whitespace) are not reported by scripts/i18n-lint.mjs: brand names, acronyms, protocol and Kubernetes identifiers, key caps. Patterns are regular expressions (u flag) matched against the whole trimmed text and cover code-shaped placeholders: URLs, SQL, CEL field access, JSONPath, JSON payloads, PEM markers, regexes, key=value, camelCase, kebab-case/dotted/slashed identifiers, broker subjects, header names, timestamps. A plain word or sentence never matches; mark those with `// i18n-ignore` when they are intentional.",
